{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A restaurant game about the beloved Vietnamese grilled pork with rice noodles dish, a popular dish in Hanoi, Vietnam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing the university entrance exam, Tom decided to take care of the family's grilled pork noodle business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with his friends, let's help Tom become successful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cute graphics and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Relaxing game play but also challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fast actions to serve customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose and hire staff members with most suitable skills for: quality, speed and food cleanliness and safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Easy to learn, easy to play and understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Perfect when you are on public transport or waiting for appointments or in queues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Buy upgrades from the store to increase your efficiency and profit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4 locations to open shop.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852860?t=1766990122","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852860?t=1766990122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852860/b6b6f10c0ad1196189ac3cadfd00d906d0d228ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766990122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852860/b6b6f10c0ad1196189ac3cadfd00d906d0d228ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766990122","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A restaurant game about the beloved Vietnamese grilled pork with rice noodles dish, a popular dish in Hanoi, Vietnam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing the university entrance exam, Tom decided to take care of the family's grilled pork noodle business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with his friends, let's help Tom become successful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Cute graphics and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Relaxing game play but also challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fast actions to serve customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose and hire staff members with most suitable skills for: quality, speed and food cleanliness and safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Easy to learn, easy to play and understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Perfect when you are on public transport or waiting for appointments or in queues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Buy upgrades from the store to increase your efficiency and profit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-4 locations to open shop.</p>","developers":["Coffee Napper Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852860/1c59400786c9313efeae928e87f7cf90154151ca/header.jpg?t=1766990122","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852860/1422265547/bcee4ba70d2a0c56e0b9ee76c3a07ed8eaf4c439/1751848738/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753750235","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852860/1422265547/bcee4ba70d2a0c56e0b9ee76c3a07ed8eaf4c439/1751848738/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753750235","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3852860/1422265547/bcee4ba70d2a0c56e0b9ee76c3a07ed8eaf4c439/1751848738/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=17537